# Mini Program typography and sheet motion

Authoritative floors live in `AGENTS.md` (Mini Program Design And Navigation) and
`miniprogram/DESIGN.md` (Layout and readability / Panel and sheet motion).
`miniprogram/design-tokens.json` `fontSize` values are rpx reference numbers only.

## Type scale (minimums)

| Role | Minimum | Typical use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Page / nav title | `32rpx` | `nav-title`, page H1 |
| Section title | `28rpx` | Card title, round title |
| Primary copy / action / business value / tappable chip | `24rpx` (key CTA may use `26–28rpx`) | Send, switch, scheme chip, Composer submit |
| Secondary helper / time / meta | `22rpx` | Subtitle, prompt summary, points copy |
| Tertiary badge | `20rpx` | On-image corner marks only (e.g. “已确认”) |
| Forbidden | `<20rpx` | Status, action, business value, or required explanation |

- Prefer `22rpx+` for helpers; do not land readable secondary copy on exactly
  `20rpx` unless it is a tertiary badge.
- Primary actions and primary copy must not use `20rpx`.
- Never use `transform: scale(...)` or image-embedded text to bypass floors.

## Restoration checklist (before editing visible UI)

1. Scan the touched Less/WXSS for `font-size` and map each rule to the table.
2. Raise any operational / business / helper text below its floor.
3. Keep `20rpx` only on explicit tertiary badge selectors (e.g. published /
   confirmed corner badges).
4. If adding or changing a bottom sheet / menu / dialog panel, add mask fade +
   the matching panel motion (~`240ms`, `ease-out`); on close, wait ~`260ms`
   before clearing `visible`. Bottom sheets use `translateY(100%)→0`. Centered
   contact/confirm cards use opacity plus a short `translateY(24rpx)→0` and
   must not slide up from the bottom.
5. Do not introduce Vant, TDesign, or other component libraries for motion.

## Sheet motion pattern

```text
bottom sheet:
  mask: opacity 0→1 (~240ms)
  panel: translateY(100%)→0 (~240ms) ease-out
centered dialog:
  mask: opacity 0→1 (~240ms)
  panel: opacity + translateY(24rpx)→0 (~240ms) ease-out
close: reverse; finish animation before setData hide
```

WXML: bind an `open` class from the existing `*Visible` flag.
Less: `transition` on the same mask/panel nodes.
